<title>POLAND: POLISH UNILEVER SELLS PLN 10 MLN TWO-MONTH CPS.</title>
<headline>POLISH UNILEVER SELLS PLN 10 MLN TWO-MONTH CPS.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-09-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Polish unit of Unilever sold on Tuesday 10 million zlotys of two-month commercial papers at a yield of 18.5 percent, the issue's agent ING Warsaw said in a statement.</p>
<p>The tranche is part of the company's 80 million zloty CPs programme launched in April, 1995.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
